OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny heavy,
OL,6,Fpossibly thundery showers will soon
OL,7,Fclear northeastwards. Remaining
OL,8,Flargely cloudy overnight, with patches
OL,9,Fof light rain and drizzle. Drier
OL,10,Fconditions will spread from the west
OL,11,Flater, with most places dry by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FGenerally dry and bright
OL,14,Fthrough the morning. Scattered showers
OL,15,Fwill develop during the afternoon,
OL,16,Fespecially in the west where they may
OL,17,Fbe heavy, before gradually spreading
OL,18,Feastwards into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
